  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.75 - AM022 ForCtorParam cycle ownership\n- Direct semantic ForCtorParam property mappings participate in AM022 cycle graphs\n- Unique constructor assignments and exact positional-record properties connect parameters to writable or read-only destination members\n- Constructor-owned edges replay through downstream maps even when MaxDepth or PreserveReferences cannot protect construction\n- Ignore and PreserveReferences cannot suppress constructor-owned recursion; MaxDepth suppresses mixed member/constructor cycles but not construction-only cycles\n- Constructor-owned diagnostics withhold automatic fixes; ConvertUsing remains the explicit ownership boundary\n- Duplicate parameters, transformed selectors, deferred helpers, invalid names, ambiguous ownership, and lookalike APIs stay excluded",
